WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.904
Week holds activities you choose to give
attention to soon. For

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:09.558
example, a trail on Saturday, one box sometime
this week, and

00:00:09.558 --> 00:00:11.250
family dates on Thursday.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.650
Trying the riverside trail supports finding
two walks you enjoy.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.950
Sorting one box supports clearing the spare-
room floor. It can stay

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:21.400
undated.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.950
Asking about dates moves the family weekend
forward.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.258
Look back up the chain: one box supports a
clear floor,

00:00:30.258 --> 00:00:34.216
a usable spare room, and a calmer home. The
goals stay

00:00:34.216 --> 00:00:38.174
on their own lists. Give this activity a day
and the

00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:42.131
same item appears in Today. You can also add
everyday tasks

00:00:42.131 --> 00:00:44.650
directly; not everything needs a bigger goal.
